          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 16 2023 22:01:49 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">4th&nbsp;generation<br>\n FP8000 camera</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">We continually improve our proprietary FP8000 camera, with today’s camera giving you more capability and options.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Pushing&nbsp;guidance forward<sup>1</sup></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Only guidance system with proprietary active optical technology</li>\n<li>Highest maximum frame rate of today’s main systems</li>\n<li>85° up/down camera tilt</li>\n<li>180° side-to-side rotation combines for virtual 360° range of motion</li>\n<li>Accommodates supine and lateral procedures</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Apr 03 2023 13:14:07 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
