              "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 17 2023 17:55:03 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">The power to personalize</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Ortho Q Guidance, along with its hip and knee softwares, gives you the choice and control to tailor your solution to personal preferences and patient cases.</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Implant choice</li>\n<li>Standard or MIS techniques</li>\n<li>Workflow configuration</li>\n<li>Surgical approach</li>\n<li>Patient positioning</li>\n<li>Custom screen displays</li>\n<li>And more</li>\n</ul>\n",
